"The lesson identifies the eyes, ears, and ________ as gateways connected to what enters the heart.", "answer": "mouth", "variants": ["tongue", "words"], "review_start": 2526, "review_end": 2611, "scripture": null}, {"lesson": 5, "number": 11, "prompt": "The lesson teaches that faith does not deny the facts, but truth can change the ________.", "answer": "facts", "variants": ["circumstances", "facts of the situation"], "review_start": 2652, "review_end": 2750, "scripture": null}, {"lesson": 5, "number": 12, "prompt": "Luke 4:18 says Jesus was anointed to preach good news, bring release, and recovery of sight to the ________.", "answer": "blind", "variants": ["physically blind"], "review_start": 2991, "review_end": 3149, "scripture": "Luke 4:18"}, {"lesson": 5, "number": 13, "prompt": "3 John 2 says, “Beloved, I pray that you may prosper and be in ________.”", "answer": "health", "variants": ["good health"], "review_start": 3315, "review_end": 3410, "scripture": "3 John 2"}, {"lesson": 5, "number": 14, "prompt": "1 Peter 2:24 says, “By whose stripes you were ________.”", "answer": "healed", "variants": ["made whole"], "review_start": 3609, "review_end": 3699, "scripture": "1 Peter 2:24"}, {"lesson": 5, "number": 15, "prompt": "The lesson teaches that healing is part of the finished work, so faith receives it ________.", "answer": "now", "variants": ["today", "right now"], "review_start": 3699, "review_end": 3885, "scripture": null}, {"lesson": 5, "number": 16, "prompt": "In Matthew 8, the centurion told Jesus to “only speak a ________” and his servant would be healed.", "answer": "word", "variants": ["the word"], "review_start": 4548, "review_end": 4644, "scripture": "Matthew 8"}, {"lesson": 5, "number": 17, "prompt": "The lesson says you must know the Word and be fully ________ about it.", "answer": "persuaded", "variants": ["convinced", "fully convinced"], "review_start": 4676, "review_end": 4714, "scripture": null}, {"lesson": 5, "number": 18, "prompt": "Matthew 8:17 says Jesus took our infirmities and bore our ________.", "answer": "sicknesses", "variants": ["diseases", "sickness"], "review_start": 4722, "review_end": 4787, "scripture": "Matthew 8:17"}, {"lesson": 5, "number": 19, "prompt": "Mark 16 says believers will lay hands on the sick and they shall ________.", "answer": "recover", "variants": ["be healed", "recover health"], "review_start": 4862, "review_end": 4934, "scripture": "Mark 16"}, {"lesson": 5, "number": 20, "prompt": "The lesson teaches that the cure for unbelief is ________.", "answer": "teaching", "variants": ["right teaching", "being taught the Word"], "review_start": 5315, "review_end": 5447, "scripture": null}, {"lesson": 6, "number": 1, "prompt": "John 10:10 says Jesus came so that we may have life and have it more ________.", "answer": "abundantly", "variants": ["abundant", "in abundance"], "review_start": 128, "review_end": 298, "scripture": "John 10:10"}, {"lesson": 6, "number": 2, "prompt": "Psalm 68:19 says God daily loads us with ________.", "answer": "benefits", "variants": ["His benefits"], "review_start": 254, "review_end": 282, "scripture": "Psalm 68:19"}, {"lesson": 6, "number": 3, "prompt": "3 John 2 teaches that God desires us to prosper and be in ________ even as our soul prospers.", "answer": "health", "variants": ["good health"], "review_start": 314, "review_end": 372, "scripture": "3 John 2"}, {"lesson": 6, "number": 4, "prompt": "The lesson teaches that soul prosperity is a prerequisite to living the ________ Life.", "answer": "Abundant", "variants": ["abundant"], "review_start": 365, "review_end": 410, "scripture": null}, {"lesson": 6, "number": 5, "prompt": "Romans 12:2 teaches believers not to be conformed to this world, but to be transformed by the renewing of their ________.", "answer": "mind", "variants": ["minds"], "review_start": 495, "review_end": 564, "scripture": "Romans 12:2"}, {"lesson": 6, "number": 6, "prompt": "The lesson teaches that old mindsets must be replaced by