t.", "answer": "God", "variants": ["God out"], "review_start": 1102, "review_end": 1125, "scripture": null}, {"lesson": 7, "number": 11, "prompt": "The third church-government model discussed is the ________ model.", "answer": "Congregational", "variants": ["congregational"], "review_start": 1572, "review_end": 1613, "scripture": null}, {"lesson": 7, "number": 12, "prompt": "In a congregational model, people often want a voice or a ________.", "answer": "vote", "variants": ["vote in decisions"], "review_start": 1581, "review_end": 1621, "scripture": null}, {"lesson": 7, "number": 13, "prompt": "The lesson teaches that personal preference can become a breeding ground for ________.", "answer": "division", "variants": ["divisions", "strife"], "review_start": 1697, "review_end": 1746, "scripture": null}, {"lesson": 7, "number": 14, "prompt": "The fourth and approved Champion Life model is ________-led leadership.", "answer": "Spirit", "variants": ["Spirit-led", "Holy Spirit-led"], "review_start": 2495, "review_end": 2538, "scripture": null}, {"lesson": 7, "number": 15, "prompt": "In Spirit-led leadership, the pastor is described as the local ________ under Jesus, the Great Shepherd.", "answer": "shepherd", "variants": ["under-shepherd", "local shepherd"], "review_start": 2501, "review_end": 2538, "scripture": null}, {"lesson": 7, "number": 16, "prompt": "The pastor’s leadership is to be exercised in ________ rather than through dictator tactics.", "answer": "love", "variants": ["loving leadership"], "review_start": 2538, "review_end": 2560, "scripture": null}, {"lesson": 7, "number": 17, "prompt": "A dictator acts for himself, while a leader acts for the benefit of those he ________.", "answer": "leads", "variants": ["serves", "leads"], "review_start": 2546, "review_end": 2560, "scripture": null}, {"lesson": 7, "number": 18, "prompt": "Champion Life uses advisory boards made up of proven ministers and pastors for ________.", "answer": "accountability", "variants": ["counsel", "accountability and counsel"], "review_start": 2560, "review_end": 2674, "scripture": null}, {"lesson": 7, "number": 19, "prompt": "The lesson says important decisions are not simply voted out or fought out; they are ________ out.", "answer": "prayed", "variants": ["prayed out"], "review_start": 2872, "review_end": 2896, "scripture": null}, {"lesson": 7, "number": 20, "prompt": "At Champion Life, the final local decision rests with the God-appointed pastor under ________-led leadership.", "answer": "Spirit", "variants": ["Spirit-led", "Holy Spirit-led"], "review_start": 3259, "review_end": 3440, "scripture": null}]$bank$::jsonb) q(lesson integer,number integer,prompt text,answer text,variants jsonb,review_start integer,review_end integer,scripture text) where c.slug='dream-track';
